WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:02.200
[Music]

00:00:08.140 --> 00:00:09.700
[Heavy impact]

00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:11.400
That was wild!

00:00:12.540 --> 00:00:13.900
Keeping tabs on me?

00:00:14.240 --> 00:00:14.950
Maybe.

00:00:15.360 --> 00:00:16.800
Did you beat Captain Ash?

00:00:17.060 --> 00:00:17.550
Huh?

00:00:18.620 --> 00:00:19.220
Nah.

00:00:19.480 --> 00:00:20.700
You’re hiding power.

00:00:20.900 --> 00:00:21.600
Fight me.

00:00:21.820 --> 00:00:23.500
Bro, I can’t be bothered.

00:00:23.650 --> 00:00:24.850
[Blade strikes stone]

00:00:25.550 --> 00:00:26.150
Whoa!

00:00:29.800 --> 00:00:31.400
[Blades clash]

00:00:36.100 --> 00:00:38.000
[Blades clash]
